    "text": "14 hours ago\nPremarket movers: Chip stocks advance, Eli Lilly climbs after late-stage trial\nEli Lilly shares rose 4%. The drugmaker said a Phase 3 trial of retatrutide results in substantial weight loss along with meaningful improvements across knee osteoarthritis pain, moderate-to-severe obstructive sleep apnea, and type 2 diabetes.\nMarvell Technology shares rose 5% as Micron Technology stock rose 4%, as semiconductor stocks bounced back after Friday's drubbing.",
